# Scenarios UnderworldGodot does not pass yet, one per line:
#
#   <game>/<name>  ~<part of the expected FAIL reason>  # the bug, with the port's file:line and the original's
#
# A listed scenario still runs and prints its failure but does not fail the run, as long as it
# fails for the listed reason: its FAIL reason must contain the ~ text, and must not start with
# "precondition:" or name an exception (then the scenario no longer reaches the bug it tests, and
# the run fails). One that starts passing fails the run until its line is removed, in the piece that
# fixes it. Original sources: https://github.com/abedegno/underworld-exhumed (uw1/src, uw2/src).

